	| Update Field New Value      | PRO Koroneiki2                                                                      |
	And the history entry number "2" with the keyword "Koroneiki QA Service Producer > Updated Team" with the field value "Contact" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki QA Service Producer > Updated Team > Koroneiki Partner Member |
	| Update Field Name           | Contact                                                                 |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                                                     |
	| Update Field New Value      | PRO Koroneiki1                                                          |
	And the history entry number "3" with the keyword "Koroneiki QA Service Producer > Updated Team" with the field value "Contact" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki QA Service Producer > Updated Team > Koroneiki Partner Member |
